Subject: [PATCH 33/38] docs: kdoc_output: add optional args to ManOutput class
Date: Wed, 18 Feb 2026 11:13:03 +0100
Message-ID: <45e9f1cccffba1d8c39b9e439efe694e1426a717.1771408406.git.mchehab+huawei@kernel.org>
